      "statement": "Yes. On 2026-08-17 NVIDIA entered into residual-value guaranties with SB Energy for leases covering approximately 4.25 GW of IT load at the Portsmouth Site, where OpenAI is the tenant. The filing states that NVIDIA’s aggregate payment obligation under its initial commitment is capped at $105 billion and describes payments tied to specified OpenAI lease-default events, subject to conditions. This establishes a signed binding guarantee for the data-center lease by the deadline, although it is not a guarantee of all project costs or debt financing. The guaranties generally become effective when the applicable leases commence, and specified ready-for-service conditions are expected to begin in 2028. (incoming; e1205–e1210)",
